{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On the eve of a new millennium.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System engineer Simon Carswell is sent to Japan to dismantle the equipment of Kurobaito Systems \u2014 a corporation that suddenly dismissed all of its staff. His task seems simple: collect the data carriers and return home. But inside the empty office, everything feels\u2026 different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the building freely, use the elevator, and unlock hidden rooms by finding keys or deciphering panel codes. Outside, rain beats against the windows, the air conditioner hums on heating mode, and the cold office walls seem almost hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Footsteps in the corridors, strange noises in the ventilation\u2026 is it all real? Paranoia, hallucinations, a dream? Why does this place feel both familiar and terrifying at the same time?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric psychological horror set in a late-90s office.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free movement between floors using the elevator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden rooms and discoveries for attentive players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story told through employee records and environmental details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A steadily growing sense of unease and doubt about reality.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005610?t=1758202956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/14b5a6399c427abdcf300d34b8fed3cf87e83e74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758202956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/926d31b627e8738fd4ba769431e599b63a2db0c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758202956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/92